  "summary": "<p>A new mid-year crime report delivers more clear proof: President Donald J. Trump’s law-and-order agenda is crushing violent crime across America. According to the Major Cities Chiefs Association, homicides in the nation’s largest cities are down 17.2% from the first half of last year — alongside sharp declines in robberies, rapes, aggravated assaults, and overall [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/icymi-violent-crime-keeps-falling-in-biggest-u-s-cities/\">ICYMI: “Violent crime keeps falling in biggest U.S. cities”</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
